        }
      },
      {
        "source": "sf",
        "start": 213.95,
        "end": 223.3,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "武汉一千赛半决赛，卡尔塔尔连赢两个抢七，淘汰了奥斯塔彭科。七个月前，她因为背伤退赛。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "point_end_ok": "回合进行中，旁白不讲这一分；段尾停在切镜头之前。"
      },
      {
        "title_card": "和拉杜卡努\n一起长大",
        "kicker": "01",
        "seconds": 7.5,
        "narration": "她在布莱顿长大。从小到大，她最常碰到的对手，叫拉杜卡努。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "u10",
        "start": 14.0,
        "end": 28.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "二〇一一年，英国十岁以下组。两个小女孩，打出了一个停不下来的回合。后来，一个拿了美网冠军，一个还在一场一场地打。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "point_end_ok": "LTA 剪的是一个长回合，段尾 28.5 停在回合进行中、广角无切点——这一段讲的是两个小孩的来路，不是比分。"
      },
      {
        "source": "lta22",
        "start": 51.7,
        "end": 57.1,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.32,
            "end": 1.84,
            "text": "Emma and I, we grew up playing each other,\n我和艾玛从小就是对手，"
          },
          {
            "at": 2.42,
            "end": 4.56,
            "text": "kind of from mini tennis.\n从迷你网球就开始了。"
          }
        ],
        "point_end_ok": "采访，不是回合。"
      },
      {
        "source": "lta22",
        "start": 92.9,
        "end": 106.9,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.26,
            "end": 2.94,
            "text": "I've got an older brother, he's five years older than me,\n我有个哥哥，比我大五岁，"
          },
          {
            "at": 3.58,
            "end": 5.58,
            "text": "and he used to play just for fun.\n他打球只是为了好玩。"
          },
          {
            "at": 6.7,
            "end": 8.6,
            "text": "And my parents used to take me up to the club,\n爸妈带我去俱乐部，"
          },
          {
            "at": 8.86,
            "end": 11.54,
            "text": "and I used to just sit on the grass and watch him play.\n我就坐在草地上看他打。"
          },
          {
            "at": 12.38,
            "end": 13.74,
            "text": "That's how it all began.\n一切就是这么开始的。"
          }
        ],
        "point_end_ok": "采访，不是回合。"
      },
      {
        "source": "lta22",
        "start": 171.6,
        "end": 181.1,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.54,
            "end": 2.24,
            "text": "I also just want to still love tennis.\n我也想一直热爱网球，"
          },
          {
            "at": 2.74,
            "end": 6.88,
            "text": "I don't want that feeling of enjoying coming on the court to ever disappear\n不想让上场的快乐消失，"
          },
          {
            "at": 7.72,
            "end": 9.28,
            "text": "and almost have to feel like a chore.\n不想让它变成一份苦差。"
          }
        ],
        "point_end_ok": "采访，不是回合。"
      },
      {
        "title_card": "一场一场\n打上来",
        "kicker": "02",
        "seconds": 9.8,
        "narration": "她个子不高，靠的是脚步和耐心，把一个又一个球救回去。她的排名，也是这么一场一场打上来的。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
