      },
      {
        "title_card": "停下来\n的半年",
        "kicker": "03",
        "seconds": 13.0,
        "narration": "两天后的第四轮，她撑不住了，四比六、三比四落后时退赛。背部应力性骨折。四个大满贯，她错过了三个，包括家门口的温网。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "doc",
        "start": 113.7,
        "end": 143.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.22,
            "end": 1.82,
            "text": "Tennis is all I've known, right?\n网球是我唯一熟悉的事，"
          },
          {
            "at": 2.34,
            "end": 3.94,
            "text": "The past 18 years I've done it every day,\n过去18年我每天都在打，"
          },
          {
            "at": 4.42,
            "end": 8.58,
            "text": "and just not being able to do that,\n突然什么都做不了，"
          },
          {
            "at": 8.84,
